const readingHints={keywords:['节点表示关键词，大小反映出现频次；连线表示在同一篇文献中出现。紫环表示较高中介中心性，年轮颜色对应年份。','Nodes are keywords, sized by occurrence frequency. Links indicate shared publications. Purple rings indicate high betweenness; ring colors encode years.'],authors:['节点代表作者，大小反映署名文献数；连线表示共同署名。作者同名、缩写差异会影响网络，需要先核对数据。','Nodes are authors sized by publication count; links indicate co-authorship. Homonyms and name variants affect the result.'],institutions:['节点来自原始机构字段，连线表示同一篇文献中的机构合作。不同写法会形成不同节点。','Nodes come from affiliation fields; links indicate affiliations on shared papers. Name variants can form separate nodes.'],bursts:['红色条段表示检测到的突现区间。强度反映频次上升程度，不能当作总发文量或影响力排名。','Red intervals show detected bursts. Strength measures an increase in occurrence rate, not total output or research impact.'],publications:['每年纳入的文献数；无年份记录与所选范围外的记录不计入。末年可能尚未完整，不应直接据此判断下降。','Annual included records; undated and out-of-range records are excluded. An incomplete final year can appear as a decline.'],heatmap:['横轴为年份，每行是一组聚类。全图共用线性色标，深色表示原始频次较高；可在数据表核查每个数值。','Columns are years and rows are clusters. One linear color scale applies to all cells; darker cells have more occurrences. Audit exact counts in the data table.'],dual_map:['左侧为施引期刊，右侧为参考文献中的被引期刊。只使用可解析的期刊引文，缺少字段时不补造关系。这不是基于 JCR 学科底图的原版双图叠加。','Left: citing journals. Right: journals parsed from cited references. Missing fields produce no invented links. This view does not use a JCR disciplinary basemap.']};
